@startuml

hide footbox
title US002 - Register an Appraisal Entity

box "Tests" #LightYellow
actor Administrator
participant ":UI" as UI
end box

participant ":RegisterAppraisalController" as RegisterAppraisalController
participant ":AppraisalRepository" as AppraisalRepository

Administrator -> UI : **1** registerAppraisalEntity(name, genres, listingTypes)

UI -> RegisterAppraisalController : **2** registerAppraisalEntity(name, genres, listingTypes)
activate RegisterAppraisalController

RegisterAppraisalController -> AppraisalRepository : **3** createNewAppraisalEntity(name, genres, listingTypes)
activate AppraisalRepository

create "appraisal1: Appraisal" as Appraisal
AppraisalRepository -> Appraisal : **4** create(name, genres, listingTypes)

AppraisalRepository --> RegisterAppraisalController : **5** appraisal1
deactivate AppraisalRepository

RegisterAppraisalController -> AppraisalRepository : **6** add(appraisal1)
activate AppraisalRepository

AppraisalRepository --> RegisterAppraisalController : **8** true
deactivate AppraisalRepository

RegisterAppraisalController --> UI : **9** success
deactivate RegisterAppraisalController

UI --> Administrator : **10** success

@enduml
